    {
      "id": "0A61808FE40FEB8B",
      "title": "Make a home together",
      "subtitle": "",
      "description": [
        "Create or join an FTB Team, then use FTB Chunks to claim your home. Team membership also determines shared quest progression.",
        "Test access with another player before trusting protection around valuables. Raiding rules remain undecided; protected cooperative play is the development default.",
        "Use Lightman's Currency for player shops and transactions. Prices are player chosen; selling to another player requires another willing buyer."
      ],
